    "body": "I was thinking after step 6 of https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#internally-create-a-new-object-implementing-the-interface (in the case where we are creating a global object). That would at least do the right thing for 2.2.1 of https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#dfn-create-operation-function (and a similar step for getters and setters).\n\nI think that leaves solving for \"exposed\". Perhaps that's a check we can bypass when we create the global.",
